    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Ding and Dong between the top and bottom of the screen as you dodge obstacles, collect points, and smash power-ups! Test your reflexes in this fast-paced arcade game and see how long you can survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>One-Button Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Tap to move from top to bottom (or vice versa). Time your moves carefully to avoid enemies and maximize your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Yet Addictive Controls</strong> \u2013 Play with a keyboard, controller, or mouse for an intuitive pick-up-and-play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fast-Paced, Endless Arcade Action</strong> \u2013 The challenge ramps up as you go, keeping you on your toes with increasingly difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Close Call Bonus System</strong> \u2013 Earn extra points for near misses, rewarding risky playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unlockable Cosmetic Skins</strong> \u2013 Customize your player with unique looks, including skins from other Adamvision Studios games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc6f <strong>Dual Mode Challenge</strong> \u2013 Play with two buttons for an extra challenge or team up with a friend on the same controller for brain-bending co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite Mode for Experts</strong> \u2013 A special mode that pushes your skills to the limit with an incredibly difficult new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Features</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Cloud Saves, Leaderboards, and Trading Cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Unique Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A mix of my own mouth-made sound effects and royalty-free SFX from FreeSFX. Music by Difourks \u2013 <i>&quot;It's Complextro &amp; Dance.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Available in 10 Languages</strong> \u2013 English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> I love making small, polished arcade games with simple mechanics that keep players coming back for &quot;one more round.&quot; <i>Ding Dong XL</i> is designed as a pure score-chaser\u2014easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback means a lot to me! If you have any questions, issues, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out via my website, discord or the forums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking out <i>Ding Dong XL</i>\u2014I hope you enjoy the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Adam Nickerson - Adamvision Studios</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/6088010867a41fdb9d24f907f60df774.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><strong>Ding and Dong between the top and bottom of the screen as you dodge obstacles, collect points, and smash power-ups! Test your reflexes in this fast-paced arcade game and see how long you can survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a39ab3ff6ed22e7f7475e64af8c8c2b2.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>One-Button Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Tap to move from top to bottom (or vice versa). Time your moves carefully to avoid enemies and maximize your score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Simple Yet Addictive Controls</strong> \u2013 Play with a keyboard, controller, or mouse for an intuitive pick-up-and-play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fast-Paced, Endless Arcade Action</strong> \u2013 The challenge ramps up as you go, keeping you on your toes with increasingly difficult obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Close Call Bonus System</strong> \u2013 Earn extra points for near misses, rewarding risky playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad <strong>Unlockable Cosmetic Skins</strong> \u2013 Customize your player with unique looks, including skins from other Adamvision Studios games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc6f <strong>Dual Mode Challenge</strong> \u2013 Play with two buttons for an extra challenge or team up with a friend on the same controller for brain-bending co-op gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Infinite Mode for Experts</strong> \u2013 A special mode that pushes your skills to the limit with an incredibly difficult new challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Steam Features</strong> \u2013 Achievements, Cloud Saves, Leaderboards, and Trading Cards </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Unique Sound Design</strong> \u2013 A mix of my own mouth-made sound effects and royalty-free SFX from FreeSFX. Music by Difourks \u2013 <i>&quot;It's Complextro &amp; Dance.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0e <strong>Available in 10 Languages</strong> \u2013 English, Russian, German, Simplified Chinese, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Japanese, and Korean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.poster.avif?t=1745903469\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.webm?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/862570/extras/a727794de5ced4cfe50f9406a8b1c39a.mp4?t=1745903469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> I love making small, polished arcade games with simple mechanics that keep players coming back for &quot;one more round.&quot; <i>Ding Dong XL</i> is designed as a pure score-chaser\u2014easy to learn, tough to master, and endlessly replayable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback means a lot to me! If you have any questions, issues, or just want to say hello, feel free to reach out via my website, discord or the forums.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thanks for checking out <i>Ding Dong XL</i>\u2014I hope you enjoy the game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Adam Nickerson - Adamvision Studios</i></p>",
    "short_description": "A fast-paced, neon-infused arcade game with simple one-button controls! Addictive, easy to learn, and perfect for quick sessions. Challenge yourself to beat your high score while waiting in queue for another game!",
